  "rootCause": "Five integration test setups interpolated a generated credential into fixed-role ALTER ROLE DDL. Generated values happened to be UUIDs, but direct literal assembly is unsafe under a broader input or future refactor.",
  "repair": "Shared TestDatabase helper binds the value to PostgreSQL format %L using PreparedStatement, then executes the returned fixed-role DDL. PostgreSQL utility role DDL cannot directly bind its password position. Existing five setup call sites use the helper; their business assertions, roles and thresholds are unchanged.",
